{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地社交平台今日（28日）在港舉行大型晚會，齊集內地、香港、泰國、韓國等知名藝人，星光熠熠，香港小生花旦盡出，包括陳豪、馬國明、黃宗澤、高海寧、龔嘉欣、蔡思貝、朱晨麗、李施嬅等，內地有「三金影后」周冬雨、內地花旦楊紫、白鹿、孟子義、劉濤等，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T10:17:08.309469+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T09:39:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T10:10:31.012644+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T10:10:31.012644+00:00","content_hash":"194abcdec41662f19c2855c37dc604071f579cf8e15501d54274cd3feda321b3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}